      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i got this really painful red bump on my arm. its like a swollen lump and it feels super warm when i touch it. it’s actually getting kinda bigger today too. i really dont want to deal with an er visit or paying for a doctor right now if i can help it... do u think i can just drain it myself at home with a needle? i have rubbing alcohol and everything so i can make sure it's clean.",
