    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, seriously? I was a little worried that was dangerous, but if you're sure it's fine as long as I'm careful with the alcohol, I'll try it. Should I also try to squeeze it really hard with my fingers to make sure all the stuff comes out, or is there a better way to do that without hurting myself too much?",
