      "content": "okay thanks. i'll try the warm compresses. but now that i'm looking at it closer, the redness is starting to spread out a bit away from the bump and it's throbbing really bad. i'm kind of getting a little dizzy too, is that normal for just a small infection? i really dont want to go to the hospital if it's just part of the process.",
